{"id":"d3a78ac9aa06ef58","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/582_分布知识逻辑.md","title":"582 分布知识逻辑","display":"582_分布知识逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 为非空有限主体集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。对任意集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,D_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},K_a,D_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span>。原子公式直接由命题变元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\)</span> 充当，不另设带标签的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}\\)</span> 构造子。显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\">\\(K_aA\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_GA\">\\(D_GA\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(K_aA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(D_GA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<p>自由命题变元函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(D_GA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(K_aA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(D_GA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{582}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{582}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{582}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,582}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,582}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。有限支撑替换集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{582}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{582})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{582}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}:\n\\{p:\\sigma(p)\\ne p\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{582})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{582}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{582}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(B,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(B,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(D_GA,\\sigma)=D_G\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(K_aA,\\sigma)=K_a\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(D_GA,\\sigma)=D_G\\operatorname{Sub}_{582}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>下列三个命题公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{582}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{582}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{582}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{582}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{582}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{582}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span>，个体知识公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_a(A\\to B)\\to(K_aA\\to K_aB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to K_aK_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{582}\n=\n\\{\\neg K_aA\\to K_a\\neg K_aA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span>，分布知识公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{DK,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_G(A\\to B)\\to(D_GA\\to D_GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{DK,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_G(A\\to B)\\to(D_GA\\to D_GB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{DT,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_GA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{DT,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_GA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_GA\\to D_GD_GA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{D_GA\\to D_GD_GA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{D5,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{\\neg D_GA\\to D_G\\neg D_GA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{D5,G}^{582}\n=\n\\{\\neg D_GA\\to D_G\\neg D_GA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>个体到群体分布约束：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Link}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to D_GA:a\\in G,\\ \\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Link}^{582}\n=\n\\{K_aA\\to D_GA:a\\in G,\\ \\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{582}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{582}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{582})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{582}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{582}\n\\cup\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4,a}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5,a}^{582})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\qquad\\qquad\n\\cup\\bigcup_{\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{DK,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{DT,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D5,G}^{582})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Link}^{582}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\qquad\\qquad\n\\cup\\bigcup_{\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}}\n(\\mathsf{Ax}_{DK,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{DT,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D4,G}^{582}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{D5,G}^{582})\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Link}^{582}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<p>MP 规则为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化规则包括</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582}=\\{((A),K_aA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582}=\\{((A),D_GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582}=\\{((A),D_GA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>必然化只作用于空依赖行。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{582}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{582}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{582}\\)</span>，并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，下列五项许可条件至少一项成立（外层连接为析取）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{582}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{582}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{582}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{582}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{582}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\text{使 }\\pi\\text{ 的末行为 }(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-结构相等\">8. 结构相等</h1>\n<p>主体集合和群体集合按集合相等处理；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=H\">\\(G=H\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_G\">\\(D_G\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_H\">\\(D_H\\)</span> 是同一构造子，否则是不同构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标特征是原始群体算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_G\">\\(D_G\\)</span>，它表示分布知识；该算子不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_a\">\\(K_a\\)</span> 的缩写，也不是公共知识 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_G\">\\(C_G\\)</span> 的固定点。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-关系语义载体与后承\">10. 关系语义载体与后承</h1>\n<p>等价关系谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqRel}_{582}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EqRel}_{582}(W,R)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nR\\subseteq W\\times W\n\\wedge\n\\forall w\\in W\\ (w,w)\\in R\n\\wedge\n\\forall u,v\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\Rightarrow(v,u)\\in R)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge\n\\forall u,v,z\\in W\\ ((u,v)\\in R\\wedge(v,z)\\in R\\Rightarrow(u,z)\\in R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>分布知识模型集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{582}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\n=\n\\{(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V):W\\ne\\varnothing,\\ \\forall a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\ \\operatorname{EqRel}_{582}(W,R_a),\\ V:\\mathsf{Prop}_{582}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\">\\(\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_{582}^{D,G}=\\bigcap_{a\\in G}R_a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_{582}^{D,G}=\\bigcap_{a\\in G}R_a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，满足关系递归定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{582}\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{582}p\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(p),\n\\qquad\nM,w\\not\\models_{582}\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{582}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{582}\\neg A\\Longleftrightarrow \\neg(M,w\\models_{582}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{582}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{582}B,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{582}A\\to B\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\neg(M,w\\models_{582}A)\\ \\vee\\ M,w\\models_{582}B,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{582}A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{582}K_aA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_a\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{582}A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}D_GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_{582}^{D,G}\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{582}A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[M,w\\models_{582}D_GA\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ ((w,v)\\in R_{582}^{D,G}\\Rightarrow M,v\\models_{582}A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义后承定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{582}^{\\mathsf K}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{582}^{\\mathsf K}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\">\\(M=(W,(R_a)_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},V)\\in\\mathsf{KMod}_{582}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{582}B)\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\ (M,w\\models_{582}B)\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models_{582}A\">\\(M,w\\models_{582}A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal DKnow_{582}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{582},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{582},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,582},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{582},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582})_{\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{582},\n\\vdash_{582},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{582},\n\\mathsf{KMod}_{582},\nR_{582}^{D,G},\n\\models_{582},\n\\models_{582}^{\\mathsf K}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal DKnow_{582}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Ag}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{582},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{582},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{582},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,582},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{582},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{582},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{582},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK,a}^{582})_{a\\in\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},\n(\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecD,G}^{582})_{\\varnothing\\ne G\\subseteq\\mathsf{Ag}_{582}},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{582},\n\\vdash_{582},\n\\operatorname{EqRel}_{582},\n\\mathsf{KMod}_{582},\nR_{582}^{D,G},\n\\models_{582},\n\\models_{582}^{\\mathsf K}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含分布知识句法、公理、规则、证明对象、可证性、关系交集语义和语义后承；不含可靠性证明或完备性证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显示约定","text":"1. 原始符号与显示约定","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元与替换","text":"3. 自由变元与替换","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则","text":"5. 推理规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-结构相等","text":"8. 结构相等","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-关系语义载体与后承","text":"10. 关系语义载体与后承","level":1},{"id":"